<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of February 17 to February 21, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   695.93 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  591.88 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			 104.05 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying     152.54 billion yen</p>
</text>
